      "value": "Sorry but this is would be nice to have sadly this is Useless, why, Copyright.\nVRChat is Free and VRChat uses models and maps form all over the place form all over and the game has the able to remake games and gameplay (if you been tinkering with Udon and SDK and prefabs you'll see it) so VRChat is not likly to be on the 3 Bois sadly, the Copyright would end it, it would not be the bugs or issues at all like many like to think, Copyright and monetizing is why it can't/won't be on the 3 players at all.",
